{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multi pass render compositing multi pass render compositing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","fileName":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[CG Integration and Render Passes]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["CG Integration and Render Passes","Layer-Based and Node-Based Compositing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multi pass render compositing multi pass render compositing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","fileName":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing","heading":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Instead of baking every CG contribution into one beauty image, a renderer can output separate color, diffuse, specular, individual-light, shadow, luminosity, normal, and depth passes. A compositor combines them with appropriate merges, blend modes, and mattes. This lets light contributions or surface appearance be adjusted after rendering without repeating a costly scene render. The amount of control depends on which quantities were actually separated: a lighting pass with a baked surface cannot offer the same retexturing freedom as a dedicated surface pass. See [[Layer-Based and Node-Based Compositing]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["CG Integration and Render Passes","Layer-Based and Node-Based Compositing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multi pass render compositing multi pass render compositing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","fileName":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multi-Pass Render Compositing","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["CG Integration and Render Passes","Layer-Based and Node-Based Compositing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}